sub:assertion {
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2025-wisdom-13> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim>;
    dc:description "On the cognitive light cone model of cancer, in which the 'cognitive light cone' is the spatiotemporal size of the homeodynamic goal states a system can pursue, cancer is a pathological rolling back to small cell-level goals: cancer cells are not more selfish but have smaller selves, treating the rest of the body as external environment.";
    dc:type "mechanism";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cancer cells are not more selfish; they have smaller selves";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/context> "Levin M, “The Multiscale Wisdom of the Body: Collective Intelligence as a Tractable Interface for Next-Generation Biomedicine”, BioEssays : news and reviews in molecular, cellular and developmental biology (2025), doi:10.1002/bies.202400196; section “Cancer and the Scaling of the Self”. Scope: Cancer in multicellular animals"
}
